            "messages": [
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m1", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T11:16:00+08:00", "full_text": "我把东西临时叫 Seamlog。现在脑子里是一张总时间线：会里一句、消息里一句、邮件里一句，最后自动吐出周报。看着会很像有答案。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m1a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T11:16:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": ["F01"], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m2", "sender_id": "usr-jia", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T11:18:00+08:00", "full_text": "你先别让它吐东西。谁会在争议里打开这张线？他想确认的又是哪一件事？", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m2a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T11:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "engineering", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m3", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T11:21:00+08:00", "full_text": "大概是负责人想知道改动怎么来的，或者预算为什么变了。我要不要先把这两类标出来？", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m3a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T11:21:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m4", "sender_id": "usr-jia", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T11:24:00+08:00", "full_text": "先去听一个真在翻记录的人。别从你想展示的页面倒推他的麻烦。你可以问他上次吵起来时先找了哪里。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m4a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T11:24:00+08:00", "author_role": "engineering", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m5", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T11:28:00+08:00", "full_text": "吴岚可能肯看一眼。我还没问材料，更没问能不能连任何项目。先约她看样子？", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m5a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T11:28:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m6", "sender_id": "usr-jia", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T11:31:00+08:00", "full_text": "可以。把“看样子”和“给数据”分两句写，别替她把第二句答了。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m6a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T11:31:00+08:00", "author_role": "engineering", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m7", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T11:35:00+08:00", "full_text": "行。我把那张全项目大图先收进草稿。它现在像一张地铁图，站名还都没定。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m7a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T11:35:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m8", "sender_id": "usr-jia", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T11:36:00+08:00", "full_text": "地铁图先别删，省得明天又画一遍。但别拿它当结论。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m8a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T11:36:00+08:00", "author_role": "engineering", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m9", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T12:02:00+08:00", "full_text": "午饭后我把问题压成三条，晚上再发给你。要是又写成产品介绍你直接骂。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m9a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T12:02:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m10", "sender_id": "usr-jia", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T12:04:00+08:00", "full_text": "不骂。每道题后面留空，别先写你盼着听见的答案。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m9", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m10a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T12:04:00+08:00", "author_role": "engineering", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m11", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T14:46:00+08:00", "full_text": "我把问题改成：上次有人问你“为什么改”时，你先翻了什么；翻到以后还缺什么；谁能说这不是一句随口提议。比问功能别扭，但至少没替他选答案。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m11a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T14:46:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m12", "sender_id": "usr-jia", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T14:52:00+08:00", "full_text": "这比“想要什么仪表盘”好。别把提议、确认和没回当同一种状态；人们往往不是忘了内容，而是记不准哪一步已经算数。先听他们怎么说，不要急着给状态起名。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m11", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m12a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T14:52:00+08:00", "author_role": "engineering", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m13", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T15:03:00+08:00", "full_text": "我原来以为一张周报会把人从翻消息里救出来。现在听起来更像是我替他们把争议压平，再把压平后的东西叫清楚。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m11", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m13a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T15:03:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m14", "sender_id": "usr-jia", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T15:07:00+08:00", "full_text": "可能。也可能有人只想少找五分钟。两种事别用一个原型证明。先拿到一次具体的翻找过程，再决定你要保留什么。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m11", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m14a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T15:07:00+08:00", "author_role": "engineering", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m15", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T15:20:00+08:00", "full_text": "我给吴岚只发“是否愿意看一个样子”。那张周报大图继续放草稿，不排开发时间。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m15a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T15:20:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m16", "sender_id": "usr-jia", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T15:24:00+08:00", "full_text": "措辞可以。她没答复时，状态就写未答复；项目名、同事和旧材料一概别先登记。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m15", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m16a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T15:24:00+08:00", "author_role": "engineering", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im1-m17", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T15:26:00+08:00", "full_text": "发完了。先去跑步，回来再看问题表。", "thread_id": "G01-im1-m15", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im1-m17a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T15:26:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}}
            ],
