            "messages": [
              {"message_id": "G01-im2-m1", "sender_id": "usr-zhao", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T20:43:00+08:00", "full_text": "九点开一局？昨天那关还在，今天我保证不乱按电梯。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im2-m1a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T20:43:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im2-m2", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T20:44:00+08:00", "full_text": "悬。我刚跑完，鞋带松了两次，回来菜还摊在门口。先让我把土冲掉，再把那件湿外套挂起来。", "thread_id": "G01-im2-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im2-m2a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T20:44:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im2-m3", "sender_id": "usr-zhao", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T20:45:00+08:00", "full_text": "你买的是青菜还是一盆土？袋子一路在掉渣。", "thread_id": "G01-im2-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im2-m3a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T20:45:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im2-m4", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T20:47:00+08:00", "full_text": "摊主多送的。葱在最下面，别顺手当垃圾扔了。", "thread_id": "G01-im2-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im2-m4a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T20:47:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im2-m5", "sender_id": "usr-zhao", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T20:49:00+08:00", "full_text": "下午是不是有快递找你？我在剪一段人声，电话响了几轮才停。来电显示是陌生号码，我没替你接。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im2-m5a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T20:49:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im2-m6", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T20:53:00+08:00", "full_text": "漏接了。短信说改天再送，不用下楼找。", "thread_id": "G01-im2-m5", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im2-m6a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T20:53:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im2-m7", "sender_id": "usr-zhao", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T21:08:00+08:00", "full_text": "锅里给你留了半碗饭，豆腐我没动。九点半还不来，我就喊阿策补位；他刚才已经问过一次。", "thread_id": "G01-im2-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im2-m7a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T21:08:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im2-m8", "sender_id": "usr-lin", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T21:12:00+08:00", "full_text": "你先喊。我刚把青菜焯上，还得洗锅，进去也只会站着不动。那半碗饭我一会儿拌豆腐吃。", "thread_id": "G01-im2-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im2-m8a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T21:12:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G01-im2-m9", "sender_id": "usr-zhao", "sent_at": "2026-03-03T21:13:00+08:00", "full_text": "行，今天不等。明晚八点我再敲你一次。", "thread_id": "G01-im2-m1", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G01-im2-m9a", "occurred_at": "2026-03-03T21:13:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D02"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
